## Added
- `internal/telemetry` package with OpenTelemetry configuration, OTLP/HTTP trace exporter, resource configuration, sampler configuration, and graceful shutdown.
- HTTP tracing middleware with W3C Trace Context/Baggage extraction.
- HTTP server span attributes for method, route, status, and duration.
- Telemetry configuration loading and validation.
- Unit tests for telemetry configuration/provider and HTTP tracing.

## Modified
- `apps/api/internal/app/app.go` initializes telemetry and gracefully shuts it down.
- `apps/api/internal/server/router.go` adds the tracing middleware.
- `apps/api/internal/config/config.go` loads OTEL_* environment variables.
- `apps/api/internal/config/validate.go` validates OTEL configuration.
- `.env.example` and Docker Compose contain disabled-by-default telemetry settings.
- `apps/api/go.mod` adds OpenTelemetry v1.46.0 dependencies.
